{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445500/extras/e7eeeda0ac596a67655b3371fa1099ab.avif?t=1767276262\" width=1560 height=840 /></span><br><br><br>Imagine being trapped in an apartment where reality keeps shifting, where every loop takes you deeper into a mystery you don\u2019t quite understand. At first, you think you\u2019re searching for your missing sister\u2026 but the more you explore, the more you realize... nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perpetuo</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you relive the same apartment over and over, but each time, the walls remember more than you do. The furniture moves, objects disappear, and something lurks in the dark\u2014something that knows you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shifting Nightmare</strong>: The apartment changes each loop, revealing new routes, rules, and threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Piece the story together from spaces, fragments, and subtle clues... no hand-holding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong>: Rituals and logic puzzles to unlock new areas and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrelenting Tension</strong>: A shadowy entity watches, adapts, and grows less predictable the deeper you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> Short, tense, replayable... built for atmospheric exploration, puzzle solving, and the occasional sharp burst of action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the cycle. Break the cycle.\u00a0</strong>Or stay trapped forever in<strong>... Perpetuo.</strong>  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Perpetual Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/92fed3be2d3271491c81e38dbfe947de4d98984d.jpg"},{"name":"The Door That Never Opens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/4f4b37f2b5cc03cfc43bc9299ac00fa82a8e50c7.jpg"},{"name":"Embrace the Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/319dc5a10e8f4b98c06e21b21038919fcc34fa01.jpg"},{"name":"Fragments of a Lost Voice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/fa79d61711ad8d3e6c746125b9907d2e836107e8.jpg"},{"name":"Off the Grid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/92f1d2a8aae5121478c9c892ea4d1f5599eeaf0c.jpg"},{"name":"Sever the Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/a16d5f17cc294746e529b777f08f5c1e1ffa73db.jpg"},{"name":"Inheritance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/40cd225c134990346a3e6334398c3795b593d91d.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Broadcast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/6df183de960fb3dbbe1f400803616ad0dd9116e3.jpg"},{"name":"Banishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/d86d0ce541f84ac148c513c5a9ba14b0c3fdf697.jpg"},{"name":"Abandonment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445500/fd2b9a0a01230695b67b329aa958027c6b98dbb3.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445500?t=1767276262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767276262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445500/09237448fdc83d5112659f593489d1a03cd01cf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767276262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445500/09237448fdc83d5112659f593489d1a03cd01cf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767276262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game uses horror themes, as such, can offer disturbing images of dead bodies and blood."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3478600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445500/extras/e7eeeda0ac596a67655b3371fa1099ab.avif?t=1767276262\" width=1560 height=840 /></span><br><br><br>Imagine being trapped in an apartment where reality keeps shifting, where every loop takes you deeper into a mystery you don\u2019t quite understand. At first, you think you\u2019re searching for your missing sister\u2026 but the more you explore, the more you realize... nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perpetuo</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you relive the same apartment over and over, but each time, the walls remember more than you do. The furniture moves, objects disappear, and something lurks in the dark\u2014something that knows you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shifting Nightmare</strong>: The apartment changes each loop, revealing new routes, rules, and threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Piece the story together from spaces, fragments, and subtle clues... no hand-holding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong>: Rituals and logic puzzles to unlock new areas and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrelenting Tension</strong>: A shadowy entity watches, adapts, and grows less predictable the deeper you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> Short, tense, replayable... built for atmospheric exploration, puzzle solving, and the occasional sharp burst of action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the cycle. Break the cycle.\u00a0</strong>Or stay trapped forever in<strong>... Perpetuo.</strong>  </p>","developers":["Nightwolf Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445500/header.jpg?t=1767276262","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3445500/1117173337/429e4fffc8e4a41edf09542eb3e6fe6956137360/1767144916/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767169622","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3445500/1117173337/429e4fffc8e4a41edf09542eb3e6fe6956137360/1767144916/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767169622","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3445500/1117173337/429e4fffc8e4a41edf09542eb3e6fe6956137360/1767144916/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767169622","id":257257251,"name":"Release Trailer Perpetuo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257257251/f9901209c3a9cc7b7ab928be7a923628a9900219/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767169622"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3445500/1357358760/d0c577f